        "requirement_text": "After successful authentication, `/chat` SHALL provision an environment-scoped personal default workspace idempotently for the signed-in account when one does not already exist, then open Chat directly in that workspace. An account SHALL NOT be blocked at a “no workspace” dead end solely because it has no customer-tenant membership. Chat SHALL provide a visible workspace selector and a user action to create and switch to another personal workspace; creating one SHALL select it for the current session. With no explicit user selection, the personal default remains the initial workspace. Preserve the user's explicit selection for the current session only when the selected workspace is still authorized.",
