        "requirement_text": "**Normative owner directive:** ALL development of the new SmartSIHub platform SHALL be initiated, orchestrated, observed and accepted through the *currently running* `https://smartaihub.app` Autonomous Implements / Autonomous Mini App Creator facilities, using their existing SPEC-224 Job/Run, Runner, Workspace, Harness and deployment authorities. `smartaihub.app` is the **temporary development control plane**, not the new SaaS Core implementation or the new production domain. This rule applies to source changes, builds, tests, release requests, UAT and repair work; executors may run CLI internally as delegated tools. An emergency out-of-band repair is permitted ONLY when the old UI/control path is nonfunctional; reconcile its exact SHA/Run/receipts back into the canonical record as soon as recovery permits. Never claim that a task was executed through the UI unless actual Run evidence confirms it.",
